    dmo:evidenceQuote "eGFR ‡25 ml/min per 1.73 m 2, normal serum potassium concentration, and albuminuria ( ‡30 mg/g [ ‡3 mg/mmol]) despite maximum tolerated dose of RAS inhibitor (RASi)" ;
