    dmo:contraCode "glp-1-ra-in-patients-with-ckd-g5-or-on-kidney-replacement-therapy" ;
    dmo:rationale "there is less available safety data for patients with CKD G5 or on kidney replacement therapy, so caution should be exercised in these groups" ;
