    dmo:evidenceQuote "Patients with T2D and albuminuria are known to be at high risk of CKD progression and cardiovascular events" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "This recommendation applies to patients with T1D or T2D." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Population Adults with CKD (G1 –G5, G5D) and diabetes (T1D and T2D)" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Population Adults with CKD (G1 –G5, G5D, G1T –G5T) and diabetes (T1D and T2D)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/kdigo-2022-clinical-practice-guideline-for-diabetes-management-in-ckd> .

