    dmo:evidenceQuote "NA\nNA\nNA\nNA\nNA Genital mycotic infection, urinary tract infections\nSOLOIST\neGFR 25–60 ml/min per 1.73 m2\nNo criteria\nDeaths from CV  causes,  hospitalizations  for HF, and \nurgent visits for HF\nDeaths from CV causes and hospitalizations and\nurgent visits for HF\nNA\nNA NA\nDKA, GI, genital mycotic infections, volume\ndepletion\nSevere hypoglycemia" ;
