    dmo:evidenceQuote "regular assessments, assisted by information technology, to facilitate individualized management and patient self-management with ongoing support in order to detect, monitor, and treat risk factors and complications early to reduce hospitalizations, multiple morbidities, and premature death." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/kdigo-2022-clinical-practice-guideline-for-diabetes-management-in-ckd> .

