<https://example.org/dmo/id/lifestyleIntervention/secondhand-smoke-exposure-reduction> a dmo:LifestyleIntervention ;
    rdfs:label "Secondhand Smoke Exposure Reduction" ;
    dmo:expectedBenefit "Secondhand smoke exposure increases the risk of adverse cardiovascular events in the general population, and associations of such events with incidence of kidney disease have also been reported." ;
