    dmo:isInsulin "false"^^xsd:boolean ;
    dmo:medicationCode "finerenone" ;
    dmo:name "finerenone" ;
    dmo:onsetMinutes "0"^^xsd:integer ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "In the FIGARO-DKD trial, patients with ACR 30 –<300 mg/g [3 –<30 mg/mmol] and eGFR 25 –90 ml/min per 1.73 m 2 or ACR 300 –5000 mg/g [30 –500 mg/mmol] and eGFR $60 ml/min per 1.73 m 2 were included ( Figure 8 ).164" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "So far, only finerenone has demonstrated clinical cardiovascular and kidney bene ﬁts." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "The FIDELIO-DKD and FIGARO-DKD trials enrolled people with T2D and CKD who were treated with standard of care at the time the trials were initiated, which included a RASi and appropriate medications to control glycemia and blood pressure." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "In the FIDELIO-DKD and FIGARO-DKD trials, serum potassium was checked 1 month after drug initiation, 4 months after drug initiation, and every 4 months thereafter. Finerenone was continued with serum potassium #5.5 mmol/l." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/kdigo-2022-clinical-practice-guideline-for-diabetes-management-in-ckd> .

