    dmo:recommendationStrength "Strong" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "A nonsteroidal MRA can be added to a RASi and an SGLT2i for treatment of T2D and CKD." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "A nonsteroidal MRA can be added to a RASi and an SGLT2i for treatment of T2D and CKD." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/kdigo-2022-clinical-practice-guideline-for-diabetes-management-in-ckd> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/advise-contraception-in-women-who-are-receiving-acei-or-arb-therapy-and-discontinue-these-agents-in-women-who-are-considering-pregnancy-or-who-become-pregnant> a dmo:Recommendation ;
