<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/although-the-rewind-trial-provided-encouraging-results-about-the-cardiovascular-outcome-benefit-of-glp-1-ra-among-patients-with-t2d-and-ckd-without-established-cvd-i-e-exclusively-primary-prevention-population-more-population-or-trial-data-would-be-useful-to-confirm-their-role-as-most-studies-have-focused-on-secondary-prevention> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Although the REWIND trial provided encouraging results about the cardiovascular outcome benefit of GLP-1 RA among patients with T2D and CKD without established CVD (i.e., exclusively primary prevention population), more population or trial data would be useful to confirm their role, as most studies have focused on secondary prevention" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "although-the-rewind-trial-provided-encouraging-results-about-the-cardiovascular-outcome-benefit-of-glp-1-ra-among-patients-with-t2d-and-ckd-without-established-cvd-i-e-exclusively-primary-prevention-population-more-population-or-trial-data-would-be-useful-to-confirm-their-role-as-most-studies-have-focused-on-secondary-prevention" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Monitoring" ;
    dmo:statement "Although the REWIND trial provided encouraging results about the cardiovascular outcome benefit of GLP-1 RA among patients with T2D and CKD without established CVD (i.e., exclusively primary prevention population), more population or trial data would be useful to confirm their role, as most studies have focused on secondary prevention." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Although the REWIND trial provided encouraging results about the cardiovascular outcome bene ﬁto fG L P - 1R A among patients with T2D and CKD without established CVD (i.e., exclusively primary prevention population), more population or trial data would be useful to con ﬁrm their role, as most studies have focused on secondary prevention." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/kdigo-2022-clinical-practice-guideline-for-diabetes-management-in-ckd> .

