    dmo:evidenceQuote "Future studies should examine whether there are safety and efﬁcacy issues of GLP-1 RA among individuals with a history of T2D and CKD who now have controlled HbA1c <6.5%. For example, among CKD patients at high risk for ASCVD, is there a bene ﬁt to using GLP-1 RA among individuals who currently have good glycemic control?" ;
