<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/treatment-with-an-angiotensin-converting-enzyme-inhibitor-or-an-angiotensin-ii-receptor-blocker-be-initiated-in-patients-with-diabetes-hypertension-and-albuminuria> a dmo:Recommendation ;
