<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/we-suggest-that-sodium-intake-be-2-g-of-sodium-per-day-or-90-mmol-of-sodium-per-day-or-5-g-of-sodium-chloride-per-day-in-patients-with-diabetes-and-ckd> a dmo:Recommendation ;
